[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10260.63, "timestamp": "02:51:00", "text": "扇子。然后我就不知道发生了什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10262.87, "timestamp": "02:51:02", "text": "现在。我的铁杆粉丝都转向日本人了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10265.429, "timestamp": "02:51:05", "text": "音乐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10269.99, "timestamp": "02:51:09", "text": "哦，我明白了。我懂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10273.349, "timestamp": "02:51:13", "text": "我不知怎么弄到了两把刀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10276.71, "timestamp": "02:51:16", "text": "两把刀。你抽到了什么？是的。得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10280.51, "timestamp": "02:51:20", "text": "主要的。 Primeax。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10285.79, "timestamp": "02:51:25", "text": "还有卡特里娜。什么？卡特里娜。哇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10291.469, "timestamp": "02:51:31", "text": "卡特里娜。很好。那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10294.6, "timestamp": "02:51:34", "text": "这把刀的名字真酷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10302.51, "timestamp": "02:51:42", "text": "呃，好像有两个东西从我这儿冒出来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10310.79, "timestamp": "02:51:50", "text": "等等，不对。呃，算了，既然你进去了，就让"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10314.71, "timestamp": "02:51:54", "text": "告诉我。范恩在这里等着。你好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10317.349, "timestamp": "02:51:57", "text": "Vson。"}]